{
  "id": "b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment",
  "level": "B2",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Streaming and entertainment",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good evening. First of all, we'd like to know something about you.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what kind of films or series do you enjoy watching?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how often do you go to the cinema?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3600
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you prefer watching things alone or with other people?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how has the way you watch films changed in the last few years?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you two photographs. I'd like you to talk about them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question about your partner's photographs.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e08-a1",
            "b2-e08-a2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your photographs show people watching films or series. Compare the photographs, and say what the people might enjoy about watching in these ways.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which way of watching do you prefer? Why?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e08-b1",
            "b2-e08-b2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your photographs show people who entertain others. Compare the photographs, and say how the people might be feeling.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 8800
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, would you like to have a job in entertainment? Why or why not?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some things that can make a film or series popular, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10700
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these things help a new series become popular?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6800
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would be the most important for its success?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6300
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about films and entertainment.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Some people say that films were better in the past. What is your opinion?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think streaming has made going to the cinema less important?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, should there be limits on the violence people can see on screen?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Can films and series help us understand other cultures?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, why do you think people enjoy watching the same series again and again?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e08-streaming-and-entertainment/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5900
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
